{"version":1,"key":"card:658","content":{"id":658,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"img","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性是用来完成","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"响应式图片","type":"formatted"},{"text":"的核心技术，需要配合 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"srcset","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 使用。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ffbe188e-bdd8-47d8-a3ab-bf5a0fb7a74c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在下载图片的时候，浏览器可能还不知道需要下载多大的图片，这个时候就可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性来对浏览器进行提示，浏览器结合视口大小和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dpr","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，以及 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中定义的查询条件找到图片会被渲染为什么大小，然后根据大小去 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"srcset","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中找到对应的图片进行下载。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f94dffb9-ae49-4d0c-9022-3ebb579de45e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<img \n  srcset=\"elva-320w.jpg 320w,\n          elva-480w.jpg 480w,\n          elva-800w.jpg 800w\"\n  sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 280px,\n         (max-width: 1000px) 440px,\n         800px\"\n  src=\"elva-800w.jpg\" \n  alt=\"Elva\"\n/>","collabId":"84d06918-3078-498b-a563-1d87543fdfa2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f82009e9-1dde-4eaa-b54d-0128faf0d272","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"ebd0264e-038e-42c9-835e-8d69472137d4"},{"children":[{"text":"假设当前视口的大小是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"375px","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dpr","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"2","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，首先匹配 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，符合 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"max-width: 600px","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，那么渲染的图片大小是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"280px","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，那么根据 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dpr","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 渲染的图片像素大小是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"280 * 2 = 560","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，根据 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"srcset","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中的定义，发现只有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"800w","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的图片符合要求，因此浏览器会下载 elva-800w.jpg 这张图片。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eafca518-60d3-4f7d-adb0-fa11de1da0a8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"为什么在下载图片的时候不知道渲染多大的图片，当主解析器在处理 HTML 文档时，另一个轻量级的预加载扫描器会快速扫描后面的代码，寻找 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<link>","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<script>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 等外部资源的 URL，目的是为了浏览器在构建 DOM 的时候就能提前把这些大文件提前进行下载准备好，因此当准备下载图片的时候可能 CSS 资源正在进行网络传输，还没有构建出 DOM 和 CSSDOM 树，不知道图片会被渲染为多大。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"25f4856c-fe60-4844-8036-faddca4197a0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"fac3f0cf-b58a-4a22-af06-37dcb051d903","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"注意事项：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"93cbcf7d-d7c3-4b7e-a8a6-11546bffabac","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性仅仅是对浏览器的提示，不会影响真正的渲染尺寸，真正的渲染尺寸还是由 CSS 决定。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3972d37e-9ac4-4f63-a64a-d846798e219b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2cf905ef-1594-4697-aabe-2d5803a89351","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中不能使用百分比单位，如果想表示相对于视口的大小，则应该使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"vw","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"11f7f18a-fc72-4f4e-86e4-406f884d8bda","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"ac79a60a-1696-4e2d-b337-554ad2918e27","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果没有设置 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"srcset","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性，或者 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"srcset","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 使用的是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"1x，2x","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 这种倍率描述符，那么 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性会被忽略。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"596d6f2f-72d4-4b70-9969-52a003901dcd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"0e46ca22-a847-419b-9a54-e0ebdf38399e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"2eed7a28-7b37-47b7-b6c7-c449d6ca5f01","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["HTML/img/sizes","浏览器/渲染机制"],"createTime":1767357016730,"updateTime":1793532615234,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532615234}}